Package: txbridge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-util1, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Maintainer: TxBridge contributors <ahenali@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: RC transmitter companion for flight simulators
 TxBridge connects supported RC transmitters to desktop flight simulators.
